  "body_markdown": "Book Appointment\n\nSanta Monica Center\n\nNov 6, 2024\n\n\n# Expert Dental Surgical & Oral Surgery Procedures in Santa Monica: Your Guide to Advanced Care\n\n\nAre you searching for experienced oral surgeons in Santa Monica? Finding the right dental surgical team for your procedure can feel overwhelming. At Santa Monica Center for Oral Surgery & Dental Implants, our board-certified surgeons combine advanced technology with gentle, expert care to ensure exceptional results for all oral surgery procedures.\n\n\n## Understanding Modern Dental Surgery in Santa Monica\n\n\nToday's dental surgical procedures have evolved dramatically. Our Santa Monica oral surgery center offers state-of-the-art solutions using advanced 3D imaging and computer-guided techniques. Whether you need wisdom teeth removal, dental implants, or complex jaw reconstruction, our surgical team ensures precise, comfortable care for every procedure.\n\n\n### Comprehensive Oral Surgery Procedures at Our Santa Monica Center\n\n\nOur expert team specializes in a full range of dental surgical procedures, including:\n\nComplex tooth extractions and wisdom teeth removal\n\nDental implant placement and restoration\n\nFacial Trauma\n\nBone grafting and tissue regeneration\n\nTMJ treatment and facial pain management\n\n\n## Why Choose Our Santa Monica Dental Surgical Team?\n\n\nWhen selecting an oral surgeon in Santa Monica, experience and expertise matter. Our surgical center stands out through:\n\nBoard-Certified Excellence: Our surgeons maintain the highest credentials in dental surgical care\n\nAdvanced Technology: State-of-the-art 3D imaging and surgical planning\n\nComprehensive Care: From consultation through recovery, we're with you every step\n\nComfort-First Approach: Multiple sedation options for anxiety-free procedures\n\nProven Results: Thousands of successful surgical procedures completed\n\n\n### The Latest Advances in Oral Surgery Procedures\n\n\nAt our Santa Monica surgical center, we utilize cutting-edge techniques that ensure:\n\nPrecise surgical planning through 3D imaging\n\nMinimally invasive procedures for faster healing\n\nComputer-guided implant placement\n\nAdvanced bone grafting solutions\n\nOptimal aesthetic and functional results\n\n\n## Your Surgical Journey in Santa Monica\n\n\nYour path to optimal oral health begins with a thorough consultation. We take time to:\n\nEvaluate your specific needs\n\nExplain all treatment options\n\nAnswer your questions\n\nCreate a customized surgical plan\n\nDiscuss sedation choices\n\n\n### Expert Care Throughout Your Recovery\n\n\nOur commitment to your care extends well beyond the surgical procedure. Our Santa Monica team provides:\n\nDetailed recovery instructions\n\n24/7 emergency support\n\nRegular follow-up care\n\nLong-term maintenance guidance\n\nContinued support for optimal results\n\n\n## Take Control of Your Oral Health Today\n\n\nDon't wait another day living with dental discomfort. Transform your smile and your confidence with Santa Monica's leading oral surgery team.\n\nBook Your Exam Today:\n\nCall: (310) 315-1034\n\nOnline: Book Your Exam\n\n\"Our team is ready to help you achieve the healthy, confident smile you deserve. Contact us today and take the first step toward optimal oral health.\"\n\n\n#### You May Also Like\n\n\n\n###### Wisdom Teeth Removal Recovery: A Day-by-Day Guide to Healing\n\n\nRead More\n\n\n###### Oral Surgeon Los Angeles: How to Choose the Right Practice Without Guessing\n\n\n\n###### Sleep Apnea Surgery: Oral Surgery Solutions\n\n\n\n##### Wisdom Teeth Removal Recovery: A Day-by-Day Guide to Healing\n\n\n\n##### Oral Surgeon Los Angeles: How to Choose the Right Practice Without Guessing\n\n\n\n### Ready to Transform Your Smile? Schedule Your Beverly Hills Consultation Today\n\n\nDon't let dental concerns hold you back from the confidence and oral health you deserve. Our Beverly Hills location offers the same exceptional care that has made us the premier choice for oral surgery in West Los Angeles and Beverly Hills for 50 years.\n\nBook Your Beverly Hills Appointment\n\n\n##### Ready to Transform Your Smile? Schedule Your Beverly Hills Consultation Today\n\n\n\n##### Ready to Transform Your Smile? Schedule Your Beverly Hills Consultation Today\n\n\n\n#### Location\n\n\nWe'd love to hear from you. Contact us today!\n\n\n##### Email\n\n\nSend us an email\n\ninfo@santamonicaoms.com\n\n\n##### Address\n\n\n2001 Wilshire Blvd, Ste. 600\n\nSanta Monica, CA 90403\n\n\n##### Phone\n\n\nGive us a call\n\n(310) 315-1034\n\n\n#### Office Hours\n\n\nClosed on Sunday and public holidays.\n\nMonday\n\nTuesday\n\nWednesday\n\nThursday\n\nFriday\n\nSaturday\n\nSunday\n\n7 am - 5 pm\n\n7 am - 4:30 pm\n\nClosed\n\n\n###### Email\n\n\n\n###### Address\n\n\n\n###### Phone\n\n\n\n###### Office Hours\n\n\nLocation\n\n\n#### Location\n\n\n\n##### Email\n\n\n\n##### Address\n\n\n\n##### Phone\n\n\n\n#### Office Hours\n\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\nAbout Us\n\nOur Surgeons\n\nOur Office\n\nTestimonials\n\nBlog\n\nReferring Doctors\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\nOrthognathic (jaw) Surgery\n\nSedation Dentistry\n\nSinus Lift\n\nTeeth-in-an-Hour™\n\nAll-on-four Dental Implants\n\nDental Implants\n\nWisdom Teeth Removal\n\n\n###### For Patients\n\n\nPay Your Bill\n\nFirst Visit\n\nPatient Registration\n\nFinancial Information\n\nBefore Anesthesia\n\nAfter Dental Implant Surgery\n\nAfter Tooth Extraction\n\nAfter Wisdom Tooth Surgery\n\nAfter Exposure Of An Impacted Tooth\n\nAfter The Removal Of Multiple Teeth\n\nJaw Fracture\n\nOrthognathic Surgery\n\nSinus Augmentation\n\n© 2025 Santa Monica Center. All rights reserved.\n\nWebsite by\n\n7Seas\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\n\n###### For Patients\n\n\n\n###### About Us\n\n\n\n###### Procedures\n\n\n\n###### For Patients",
